{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "669677024b02bef9603478e98173e001daa8819bcd7dac8a5218780c05dd1355", "ja": "（今日の仕事は、重要文化財に指定されているホテルの\n紹介。百合子の情熱溢れる語り口が、好評だった！）", "zh": "（今天的工作是介绍一座被指定为重要文化财产的酒店。百合子充满热情的讲解大受好评！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur01_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "9f046e184c1f238f2e16197e5d3b9551a4d5f00d10516a86dac074e7ba1e97d1", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　私、感激ですっ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！我太感动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "cfe0af49bed391e80fea4854ee3851a1bc6bdd07847450c3259251969a6a9c70", "ja": "お疲れ様、百合子。\nリポーターは終わったのに、テンションが高いな！", "zh": "辛苦了，百合子。\n采访都结束了，你的情绪还是很高涨啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur01_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "5415ceabae1860859065e914e3382fc58f8f1d0f3d890784cd33a53c55697a0b", "ja": "高くもなりますよ！　だって、\nこんな素敵な場所に連れてきてもらえたんですから！", "zh": "当然会兴奋啦！因为能被带到这么棒的地方来嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur01_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "369959b5bfa87d20f2fcf6c6fe9693ff3a257b9cdd209b0ca91aa3871516c0c2", "ja": "古き良き時代に建てられた、木造の純西洋建築……\n『軽井沢の鹿鳴館』とも言われていたそうですよ！", "zh": "据说这座木结构的纯西洋建筑建于美好的旧时代……\n还被称为“轻井泽的鹿鸣馆”呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "bdea9cd932630f4ffaa41c0f7cee8c89250d19b73619f21e6133262986030aca", "ja": "百合子が好きそうな仕事だとは思ったけど……\n気に入ったなら良かったよ。", "zh": "我就觉得这是百合子会喜欢的工作……\n你喜欢就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur01_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "a70f1b8c13fc7a8fb0900b11fa13b88680dc349b8544c2fe3a0e9fed7493503b", "ja": "気に入るなんてもんじゃないです！\nこれは夢ですよ、夢！　夢の中の夢っ……！", "zh": "这哪里只是喜欢啊！\n这是梦想，是梦想！梦中的梦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur01_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "c4011c788de1cd28d44e83e46011aec5a5401e66c7d458c3252f51c0d5c0c28a", "ja": "このホテルは、文化人や財界人が避暑地として訪れ、\n社交場として利用したんだそうです！", "zh": "听说这家酒店曾有许多文化界人士和财界人士前来避暑，还把这里当作社交场所使用！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur01_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "591b1325cc664190e3a31806ef01ef57bcca4285f1e58bc7b9130f5b066acc36", "ja": "絶対、スパイが忍び込んでましたよね！？\n各国のスパイが、豪華絢爛なパーティーで……ああっ！", "zh": "绝对有间谍潜入了吧！？各国的间谍混在那场金碧辉煌的派对里……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d8903f2f7d43ba103a6250ff09afeeaed57ca4cac01f0cd1d93fea76d9c652c7", "ja": "そこでスパイなんだな……。", "zh": "所以你就是间谍啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur01_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "875d2349b29e2daeca985b864471efb054b00849c4ebc082776bd93b70e5f27e", "ja": "スリルと情熱！　各国の思惑、運命の選択……！\nそして私は知らず、異国のスパイと恋に落ちて……！", "zh": "惊险与热情！各国的谋划、命运的抉择……！\n而我却在不知不觉间，爱上了外国的间谍……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_026yur01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_026yur01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "af3c8709800b88563283af3b4041531e2fbbc2652af84bae2ae603c5a26cd4ce", "ja": "（完全に自分の世界に入っているな……。\nでも、百合子も楽しめたみたいで良かったな！）", "zh": "（完全沉浸在自己的世界里了啊……。\n不过，百合子能享受其中就好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
